# Apertus2 Megachonk, block-FP8 checkpoint: routed experts, shared experts and dense MLPs in FP8 E4M3
# (128x128 weight blocks, dynamic activations), the rest BF16. Made with swiss-ai/hfconverter#8
# (llm-compressor model_free_ptq, FP8_BLOCK; compressed-tensors format) from the BF16 checkpoint
# of the megachonk profile (2026-11-24, job 5447754). vLLM reads the quantization from the checkpoint, so no
# scenario layer sets it. Everything else is the megachonk profile.
MODEL_REPO="${MODEL_REPO:-swiss-ai/apertus2-megachonk-fp8-mlps}"
source "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/megachonk.env"
MODEL_DIR=/iopsstor/scratch/cscs/anowak/tmp/hfconverter-megachonk-fp8-all-mlps-20261124T1830/megachonk-fp8-all-mlps
